# Backend Architecture

- Controllers: request in → FormRequest/service → Resource/response. No provider HTTP or long workflows.
- Application services own import/catalog workflows and transactions.
- Domain models own persistence shape and relationships.
- Infrastructure owns PokéAPI HTTP, mapping, retries, trusted URL checks.
- Do not add Repository wrappers that only proxy Eloquent.
- Prefer constructor DI over facades inside new application services.

```php
// ❌ BAD in controller
Http::get('https://pokeapi.co/...')->json();

// ✅ GOOD
$creature = $this->catalog->findBySlug($slug);
return new CreatureResource($creature);
```
